sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / Repository Owner
    participant Agent as Coding Agent
    participant Router as "AGENTS.md"
    participant CLI as corebase-specharness CLI
    participant Routes as "context-routes.yaml"
    participant Skills as "Peer Skills"
    participant Feat as "artifacts/features/<slug>/"
    participant Session as ".corebase-specharness/sessions/<slug>/session.md"
    participant Harness as "Confirmed Gates"
    participant KB as Durable Memory

    Dev->>Agent: Request a feature or maintenance task
    Agent->>Router: Read operating contract<br/>direct skill entry · deterministic CLI operations
    Agent->>CLI: skill-enter(skill, feature, intent)
    CLI->>Routes: Read phase, profile, feature requirement, and sources
    CLI->>Feat: Create status.md if needed and write enter token
    CLI->>Feat: Read route-declared feature artifacts
    CLI->>Session: Create session.md or resume it in place
    CLI-->>Agent: Selected and omitted context with token estimates

    Agent->>Skills: Execute named skill procedure<br/>(e.g. /spec-requirements, /spec-plan, /spec-tasks)
    Skills->>Feat: Write spec.md, plan.md, or tasks.md
    Agent->>CLI: session-checkpoint(feature, progress, next-action)
    CLI->>Session: Append progress and handoff updates

    alt Implement Phase — Task Loop
        loop For each ready task in tasks.md
            Agent->>CLI: task-check(feature)
            Agent->>CLI: task-start(feature, task: T-NNN)
            Agent->>Agent: Edit source, run local proof
            Agent->>CLI: task-done(feature, task: T-NNN, evidence)
            CLI->>Feat: Record evidence, mark T-NNN Done, sync tasks.json
            Agent->>CLI: session-checkpoint(feature, progress)
        end
    end

    Agent->>Skills: Run /harness-verify
    Agent->>CLI: skill-enter(skill: harness-verify, feature)
    Skills->>CLI: phase-check + artifact-check(trace) + verify(skill: harness-verify)
    CLI->>Feat: Validate readiness, schema, and AC traceability
    CLI->>Harness: Run confirmed argv-safe project gates
    Harness-->>CLI: Gate results
    CLI-->>Skills: Mechanical verification outcome<br/>ok / deferred / failed · details.verified

    alt Gate Fail / Traceability Error / Design Gap / verified: false
        Skills->>CLI: skill-exit(phase: ChangesRequested, handoff: spec-implement)
        CLI->>Feat: Reopen tasks or return to spec/plan
        Agent-->>Dev: Fail or deferred verdict + findings
    else Verdict Pass and details.verified is true
        Skills->>Feat: Write review.md and ## Post-Ship Sync
        Skills->>CLI: skill-exit(skill: harness-verify, handoff: context-memory)
        CLI->>Feat: Set status.md phase to Done
        Skills->>KB: /context-memory
        KB->>Feat: Triage session-extracts.md and record sync
        Agent->>CLI: session-end(feature, next-action, candidate)
        CLI->>Session: Append final handoff and retain session.md
        Agent-->>Dev: Done verdict + summary
    end

    Note over Agent,KB: Installed paths are project-local. kit/ is used only when maintaining or installing the source package.
